KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ shadowing struct named like a builtin trait: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Passes in gcc mode on gcc<=13 hosts; fails in CLANG mode anywhere and
in gcc mode on gcc>=14 hosts (libstdc++-14 <type_traits> unparseable:
valarray1 and anything including <string> breaks in fedora:41).
Fix: gcc-style followed-by-'(' lookahead, as already done for
__is_referenceable in scanner.l.
